[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/157452496","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/965#issuecomment-157452496","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/965","id":157452496,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE1NzQ1MjQ5Ng==","user":{"login":"Avetri","id":13541898,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTQxODk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13541898?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri","html_url":"https://github.com/Avetri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-11-17T17:55:27Z","updated_at":"2015-11-17T17:55:27Z","body":"How to made according to the standard:\n\n<pre>\n...\n//                    If there no sequence_display_extension()\n//                                horizontal_size\n//                    SAR = DAR × ---------------\n//                                vertical_size\n//\n//                    aspect_ratio_information  Sample Aspect    Ratio DAR\n//                                0000              forbidden      forbidden\n//                                0001             1,0 (Square\n//                                                   Sample)           -\n//                                0010                  -             3÷4\n//                                0011                  -             9÷16\n//                                0100                  -             1÷2,21\n//                                0101                  -           reserved\n//                                ...                                 ...\n//                                1111                  -           reserved\n                    float DAR[] = {-1f, -1f, 3f/4f, 9f/16f, 1f/2.21f};\n                    float pixelWidthHeightRatio = 1.0f;\n                    if (seqHeader.getAspectRatioInformation()>=2 || seqHeader.getAspectRatioInformation()<=4)\n                    {\n                        pixelWidthHeightRatio = DAR[seqHeader.getAspectRatioInformation()]*((float)seqHeader.getHorizontalSizeValue()/(float)seqHeader.getVerticalSizeValue());\n                    }\n...\n</pre>\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/157452496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Avetri","id":13541898,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTQxODk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13541898?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri","html_url":"https://github.com/Avetri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Avetri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/157458130","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/965#issuecomment-157458130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/965","id":157458130,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE1NzQ1ODEzMA==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-11-17T18:17:46Z","updated_at":"2015-11-17T18:18:00Z","body":"I'm slightly unclear why you think the existing code doesn't match the spec. Looking just at the first case in the existing code:\n\n```\npixelWidthHeightRatio = (3 * width) / (float) (4 * height);\n```\n\nThis (ignoring floating point considerations) is the same as `(3/4)*(width/height)`, where `3/4` is the correct `DAR` value, and `width/height` is `horizontal_size/vertical_size`.\n\nDid I misunderstand something? Also, do you have sample content with non-square samples that you could share? I have a sample that has `aspectRatioCode = 3`, but the pixels are still square, meaning that both code blocks produce an identical result (i.e. It's not a useful sample :)).\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reaction